# Frontend (Angular POS)

## UX
- POS order-taking: minimal chrome, large touch targets, fast path to cart
- Prefer toasts over `alert()` / `confirm()`
- One design token system (CSS variables); avoid mixed color themes per screen
- Customer website/mobile apps are separate shells — do not extend this admin UI for customers

## API
- Always call APIs via `environment.apiUrl` — never hardcode `localhost:8080`
- Auth interceptor attaches Bearer token; avoid duplicating headers unless necessary
- Protect staff routes with `AuthGuard`; admin routes with `AdminGuard`

## Code style
- Prefer standalone components
- Keep order-taking focused: search, sizes, add-ons, cart, place order
- Branch/payment defaults come from logged-in user / settings, not magic numbers in templates
